{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young child named Alex finds himself trapped in a dying world. You are to guide, protect, and help him find a way back home. The game knows you exist, and you are able to influence it through unconventional means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be wary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the connection is initiated, your choices will be irreversible...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the fate of the world will lie in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not mess this up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Gameplay mechanics that go beyond the limits of the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique relationship between the game world and the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of fun and unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interesting and immersive narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVING THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is saved upon closing the game window. Do not worry, you will be able to pick up where you left off.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666320?t=1762444936","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666320?t=1762444936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666320/de130ccd443d41c91aead0a4a29e2f41e3238d4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762444936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666320/de130ccd443d41c91aead0a4a29e2f41e3238d4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762444936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id"